ire with a Face scanner - Warp filter.\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Catch up trending  filters and create interesting photos and videos with the Time warp filter camera effect & face swap.\r\n\r\n<b> Key Features Time Warp Scan - Time Warp Filter Camera </b>\r\n\ud83d\udd30 Time warp scan photo filter and face scan easily\r\n\ud83d\udd30 Time warp scan or warp scan with line camera & face scanner function\r\n\ud83d\udd30 Support face warp, face filters and Photo Warp\r\n\ud83d\udd30 No watermark after using face scan /warp filter \r\n\ud83d\udd30 Use Time warp scan effects, slit scan effects, face filter effects, and face distortion function\r\n\ud83d\udd30 Give the body parts more special & creative shapes\r\n\ud83d\udd30 Choose \"blue line scanner\" direction by vertical or horizontal\r\n\ud83d\udd30 Adjust the speed of the \" blue line filter \" as you want.\r\n\ud83d\udd30 After creating photos & videos with the Time warp filter app save them to the gallery.\r\n\ud83d\udd30 Time warp face scan or Time warp effect makes the face transform into another shape.\r\n\ud83d\udd30 With Time warp scan 3d converts images to different funny looks when time warp's Blue line filter warp slider is over.\r\n\r\n<b>How to Use Time Warp Scanner - Face Scanner Filters? \ud83e\udd29</b>\r\n\u2705  After installation of the Time Warp Scan funny filter photo Warp app.\r\n\u2705  Choose the direction of the face warp scanner or Line Camera: Time warp face scan app as you want like horizontal and vertical.\r\n\u2705  Create your own photos with the time warp slider/ face warp filter\r\n\u2705  After applying time warp effects/face filter, you can also share them with friends and family and save them in your gallery.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s Warp scan or Warp Time! Now Create amazing photos by using face scanner - face warp scan filters and discover trending effects of social media with the help of this Time Warp Scan effect!  In this Time Warp use multiple face filters/effects which make your photo/images